{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250430/extras/Logo.png?t=1753319260\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awake in the depths of an abandoned Soviet facility. Survive hordes of the undead by growing your undead killing arsenal. Find and upgrade your weapon, loot for explosives and equipment, and set up traps to slaughter the dead. Descend deeper into the lab to uncover hidden secrets and ways to enhance your arsenal beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong> Find attachments to upgrade your weapons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5<strong>\u00a0Loot for explosives and equipment to make killing the undead a breeze.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddea<strong> Inject serums to enhance your zombie killing skills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf<strong> Uncover an undead way of upgrading your firearms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NARRATIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Soviets knew they would lose the war. In a desperate attempt at victory, they unleashed a hell upon the battlefront that would consume Europe...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a zombie infested lab in Vietnam, the only way out is to descend into pure chaos. As you go from room to room slaughtering the undead, you'll go deeper into the trenches of your mind to uncover the truth of the outbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3250430?t=1753319260","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3250430?t=1753319260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250430/203e7d3cfe25d90b022979316cb69854830301c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753319260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250430/203e7d3cfe25d90b022979316cb69854830301c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753319260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Killing lots and lots of zombies, with lots and lots of blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250430/extras/Logo.png?t=1753319260\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awake in the depths of an abandoned Soviet facility. Survive hordes of the undead by growing your undead killing arsenal. Find and upgrade your weapon, loot for explosives and equipment, and set up traps to slaughter the dead. Descend deeper into the lab to uncover hidden secrets and ways to enhance your arsenal beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong> Find attachments to upgrade your weapons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5<strong>\u00a0Loot for explosives and equipment to make killing the undead a breeze.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddea<strong> Inject serums to enhance your zombie killing skills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf<strong> Uncover an undead way of upgrading your firearms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NARRATIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Soviets knew they would lose the war. In a desperate attempt at victory, they unleashed a hell upon the battlefront that would consume Europe...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a zombie infested lab in Vietnam, the only way out is to descend into pure chaos. As you go from room to room slaughtering the undead, you'll go deeper into the trenches of your mind to uncover the truth of the outbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Futuremore Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250430/03dd0714fa8fadf1e4fc708f4699738b4b944c3d/header.jpg?t=1753319260","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130567,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130567/movie480.mp4?t=1745593053","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130567/movie_max.mp4?t=1745593053"},"name":"Alpha Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130567/847a9b53d1e454d38dfca0805a3417b1ac1919fd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745593053","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130567/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745593053","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130567/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745593053"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257113156,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113156/movie480.mp4?t=1741968663","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113156/movie_max.mp4?t=1741968663"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113156/1467f7fdc3bf7eb4df172d1e68b3abec49e1f619/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741968663","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113156/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741968663","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113156/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741968663"}}],"name":"Absolutio